WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Atomic arrangement and bonding help explain material properties, but a simple particle sketch is not a complete material model.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Compare a schematic ordered lattice with a polymer chain; connect each to a property question, not an unsupported ranking.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Model matching

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A material category is not a guarantee of strength, durability or safety. Processing and test conditions matter.

